 person on payment of such fee as the State Government may fix.", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "overriding", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": true, "delegation_type": "notification", "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": ["Amendment Act, 2021"], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1957.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/20096?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_20096/act.pdf", "record_id": "ec5f3e07f7b9eda98b0d", "preprocessing_info": {"source_record_number": 160, "original_text_length": 1749, "cleaned_text_length": 1749, "transformations": [], "preprocessing_status": "completed"}, "quality_control": {"decision": "quarantined", "audit_flagged": true, "manual_review_status": "not_reviewed", "review_message": "Review status is 'not_reviewed'."}}
{"act_id": "IND_state_19013", "chunk_id": "IND_state_19013_s016", "title": "The regiatrstion act, 1908", "chapter": "", "section_number": "16", "section_title": "The regiatrstion act, 1908", "text": "Act: The regiatrstion act, 1908 (Act 16 of 1908) | India | State | In Force\nSection 16: Register-books and fire-proof boxes**\n\n**16. Register-books and fire-proof boxes** .—( _1_ ) The[1] [State Government] shall provide for the office of every registering officer the books necessary for the purposes of this Act.\n\n( _2_ ) The books so provided shall contain the forms from time to time prescribed by the InspectorGeneral, with the sanction of the[1] [State Government], and the pages of such books shall be consecutively numbered in print, and the number of pages in each book shall be certified on the title page by the officer by whom such books are issued.\n\n( _3_ ) The[1] [State Government] shall supply the office of every Registrar with a fire-proof box, and shall in each district make suitable provision for the safe custody of the records connected with the registration of documents in such district.", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "mandatory", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1908.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/19013?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_19013/act.pdf", "record_id": "ad8bb38e56903a89d455", "preprocessing_info": {"source_record_number": 161, "original_text_length": 912, "cleaned_text_length": 912, "tra