{"act_id": "IND_state_19319", "chunk_id": "IND_state_19319_s068_p1", "title": "The Waqf Act, 1995", "chapter": "VI", "section_number": "68", "section_title": "The Waqf Act, 1995", "text": "Act: The Waqf Act, 1995 (Act 43 of 1995) | India | State | In Force\nChapter VI: ## MAINTENANCE OF ACCOUNTS OF[2] [AUQAF] | Section 68: Duty of mutawalli or committee to deliver possession of records, etc\n\n( _2_ ) Where any removed mutawalli or committee fails to deliver charge or deliver possession of the records, accounts and properties (including cash) to the successor mutawalli or committee within the time specified in sub-section ( _1_ ), or prevents or obstructs such mutawalli or committee, from obtaining possession thereof after expiry of the period aforesaid, the successor mutawalli or any member of the successor committee may make an application, accompanied by a certified copy of the order appointing such successor mutawalli or committee, to any[1] [District Magistrate, Additional District Magistrate, Sub-Divisional Magistrate or their equivalent] within the local limits of whose jurisdiction any part of the 2[waqf] property is situated and, thereupon such 1[District Magistrate, Additional District Magistrate, Sub-Divisional Magistrate or their equivalent] may, after giving notice to the removed mutawalli or members of the removed committee, make an order directing the delivery of charge and possession of such records, accounts and properties (including cash ) of the[2] [waqf] to the successor mutawalli or the committee, as the case may be, within such time as may be specified in the order.", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "mandatory", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 1, "year": 1995.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/19319?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_19319/act.pdf", "record_id": "da84e2b830f5794d7ae4", "preprocessing_info": {"source_record_number": 168, "original_text_length": 1422, "cleaned_text_length": 1422, "transformations": [], "preprocessing_status": "completed"}, "quality_control": {"decision": "quarantined", "audit_flagged": true, "manual_review_status": "not_reviewed", "review_message": "Review status is 'not_reviewed'."}}
{"act_id": "IND_state_19002", "chunk_id": "IND_state_19002_s001", "title": "The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Prevention of Defacement of Property Regulation 1987", "chapter": "", "section_number": "1", "section_title": "The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Prevention of Defacement of Property Regulation 1987", "text": "Act: The Andaman and Nicobar Islands Prevention of Defacement of Property Regulation 1987 (Act 1 of 1987) | India | State | In Force\nSection 1: Short Titles, Extent and Commencement\n\n1. Short Titles, Extent and Commencement\n(1) This Regulation may be called the Andaman and Nicobar Islands\nPrevention of Defacement of Property Regulation, 1987.\n\n1\n(2) It extends to the whole of the Union territory of the Andaman and\nNicobar Islands.\n\n1\n(3) It shall come into force at once,\n\n1", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "mandatory", "section_type": "short_title", "legal_subject": "['property_law']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1987.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/19002?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_19002/act.pdf", "record_id": "f73550c60c91e9c1c387", "preprocessing_info": {"source_record_number": 169, "original_text_length": 478, "cleaned_text_length": 478, "transformations": [], "preprocessing_status": "completed"}, "quality_control": {"decision": "quarantined", "audit_flagged": true, "manual_review_status": "not_reviewed", "review_message": "Review status is 'not_reviewed'."}}
