{"act_id": "IND_state_20096", "chunk_id": "IND_state_20096_s001_p2", "title": "The Mines and Minerals (Development and Reguation), Act, 1957", "chapter": "IV", "section_number": "1", "section_title": "The Mines and Minerals (Development and Reguation), Act, 1957", "text": "Act: The Mines and Minerals (Development and Reguation), Act, 1957 (Act 67 of 1957) | India | State | In Force\nChapter IV: 4[RULES FOR REGULATING THE GRANT OF MINERAL CONCESSIONS] | Section 1: The clause (ac) omitted by Act 16 of 2023, s. 14 (w.e.f. 17-8-2023)\n\n( _qqg_ ) the time limits for various stages in processing applications for grant of[6] [mineral concession under section 10B, 10BA, 11, 11A, 11B, 11D], and section 17A, and their renewals; 7* * * * * ( _qqi_ ) the terms and conditions for grant of 8[composite licence] under sub-section ( _4_ ) of section 11;\n\n( _qqj_ ) the terms and conditions, and procedure, including the bidding parameters for the selection under sub-section ( _6_ ) of section 11;\n\n> 9[( _qqja_ ) the terms and conditions and amount or transfer charges under the proviso to sub-section ( _6_ ) of section 12A;]\n\n**==> picture [450 x 38] intentionally omitted <==**\n\n> 1. Omitted by Act 37 of 1986, s. 11 (w.e.f. 10-2-1987).\n\n> 2. Subs. by Act 16 of 2021, s. 2, for \"reconnaissance permit, prospecting licence or mining lease\" (w.e.f. 28-3-2021).\n\n> 3. Ins. by Act 37 of 1986, s. 11 (w.e.f. 10-2-1987).", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "mandatory", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1957.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/20096?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publi