{"act_id": "IND_state_18999", "chunk_id": "IND_state_18999_s092", "title": "The factories act, 1948", "chapter": "X", "section_number": "92", "section_title": "The factories act, 1948", "text": "Act: The factories act, 1948 (Act 63 of 1948) | India | State | In Force\nChapter X: PENALTIES AND\nPROCEDURE\n``` | Section 92: General penalty for offences. Save as is otherwise expressly\n\n92. General penalty for offences. Save as is otherwise expressly\nprovided in this Act and subject to the provisions of section 93, if\nin, or in respect of, any factory there is any contravention of any of\nthe provisions of this Act or of any rules made thereunder or of any\norder in writing given thereunder, the occupier and manager of the\nfactory shall each be guilty of an offence and punishable with\nimprisonment for a term which may extend to 2*[two years] or with fine\nwhich may extend to 2*[one lakh rupees] or with both, and if the\ncontravention is continued after conviction, with a further fine which\nmay extend to 2*[one thousand rupees] for each day on which the\ncontravention is so continued:\n3*[Provided that where contravention of any of the provisions of", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "mandatory", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1948.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/18999?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_18999/act.pdf", "record_id": "133cb9cba541558087c8", "preprocessing_info": {"source_record_number": 290, "original_t