{"act_id": "IND_state_19318", "chunk_id": "IND_state_19318_s096_p4", "title": "The Motor Vehicle Act, 1939", "chapter": "II", "section_number": "96", "section_title": "The Motor Vehicle Act, 1939", "text": "Act: The Motor Vehicle Act, 1939 (Act 4 of 1939) | India | State | In Force\nChapter II: ** | Section 96: Power of State Government to make rules for the purposes of this**\n\n**Chapter\n\n(xxix) the licensing of agents engaged in the business of collecting for forwarding and distributing goods carried by goods carriages ;\n\n(xxx) the inspection of transport vehicles and their contents and of the permits relating to them ;\n\n(xxxi) the carriage of persons other than the driver in goods carriages;\n\n(xxxii)the records to be maintained and the returns to be furnished by the owners of transport vehicles ; and\n\n(xxxiii) any other matter which is to be or may be prescribed.\n\n_**Corresponding Law**_ **;-** Section 96 corresponds to section 68 of the motor vehicles Act, 1939.\n\n_**Object and Reasons**_ **;-** Clause 96 provides that the State Government may make rules for the purpose of carrying into effect the provisions of this Chapter.\n\n## **CHAPTER - VI**\n\n## **Special Provisions Relating To State Transport Undertakings**\n\n\" **97. Definition. -** In this Chapter, unless the context otherwise requires, road transport service\" means a service of motor vehicles carrying passengers or goods or both by road for hire or reward.\n\n_**Corresponding Law.**_ **-** Section 97 corresponds to section 68 - A (a) of the motor vehicles Act, 1939.\n\n_**Objects and Reasons.**_ **-** Clause 97 seeks to define certain expression used in this Chapter.", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "overriding", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": true, "delegation_type": "rules", "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": ["Motor Vehicles Act, 1998"], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1939.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/19318?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_19318/act.pdf", "record_id": "b395d39c6eb46a0b8ad6", "preprocessing_info": {"source_record_number": 314, "original_text_length": 1440, "cleaned_text_length": 1440, "transformations": [], "preprocessing_status": "completed"}, "quality_control": {"decision": "quarantined", "audit_flagged": true, "manual_review_status": "not_reviewed", "review_message": "Review status is 'not_reviewed'."}}
{"act_id": "IND_state_18999", "chunk_id": "IND_state_18999_s061_7", "title": "The factories act, 1948", "chapter": "VI", "section_number": "61", "section_title": "The factories act, 1948", "text": "Act: The factories act, 1948 (Act 63 of 1948) | India | State | In Force\nChapter VI: ``` | Section 61(7): Notice of periods of work for adults. (1) There shall be\n\n(7) Where any group is to work on a system of shifts and the\nrelays are to be subject to predetermined periodical changes of\nshifts, the manager of the factory shall draw up a scheme of shifts\nwhere-under the periods during which any relay of the group may be\nrequired to work and the relay which will be working at any time of\nthe day shall be known for any day.\n```\n\n```", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "mandatory", "section_type": "sub_section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 2, "year": 1948.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/18999?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_18999/act.pdf", "record_id": "db76aab3ef8c39651fea", "preprocessing_info": {"source_record_number": 316, "original_text_length": 536, "cleaned_text_length": 536, "transformations": [], "preprocessing_status": "completed"}, "quality_control": {"decision": "quarantined", "audit_flagged": true, "manual_review_status": "not_reviewed", "review_message": "Review status is 'not_reviewed'."}}
{"act_id": "IND_state_18999", "chunk_id": "IND_state_18999_s063_d1", "title": "The factories act, 1948", "chapter": "VI", "section_number": "63", "section_title": "The factories act, 1948", "text": "Act: The factories act, 1948 (Act 63 of 1948) | India | State | In Force\nChapter VI: ``` | Section 63: Hours of work to correspond with notice under section 61 and\n\n63. Hours of work to correspond with notice under section 61 and\nregister under section 62. No adult worker shall be required or\nallowed to work in any factory otherwise than in accordance with the\nnotice of periods of work for adults displayed in the factory and the\nentries made before-hand against his name in the register of adult\nworkers of the factory.\n```\n\n```\n64.\n```\n\n```\nPower to make exempting rules.\n```\n\n```", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "mandatory", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": [], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1948.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/18999?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_18999/act.pdf", "record_id": "72c6b5456d8c33de7e42", "preprocessing_info": {"source_record_number": 319, "original_text_length": 585, "cleaned_text_length": 585, "transformations": [], "preprocessing_status": "completed"}, "quality_control": {"decision": "quarantined", "audit_flagged": true, "manual_review_status": "not_reviewed", "review_message": "Review status is 'not_reviewed'."}}
