{"act_id": "IND_state_19318", "chunk_id": "IND_state_19318_s044", "title": "The Motor Vehicle Act, 1939", "chapter": "II", "section_number": "44", "section_title": "The Motor Vehicle Act, 1939", "text": "Act: The Motor Vehicle Act, 1939 (Act 4 of 1939) | India | State | In Force\nChapter II: ** | Section 44: The word \"or\" omitted by Act 54 of 1994, S. 23 ( w.e.f. 14-11-1994 ). 45. Inserted, ibid ( w.e.f. 14-11-1994 )\n\n44. The word \"or\" omitted by Act 54 of 1994, S. 23 ( w.e.f. 14-11-1994 ). 45. Inserted, ibid ( w.e.f. 14-11-1994 ).\n\n46. Inserted, ibid ( w.e.f. 14-11-1994 ).\n\n_**Corresponding Law**_ **:-** Section 71 corresponds to section 47 of the Motor\n\nVehicles Act, 1939.\n\n_**Objects and Reasons**_ **-** Clause 71 lays down the procedure in considering applications for stage carriage permits by the Regional Transport Authorities and also provides for empowering the State Government to issue direction to the Transport authorities to limit the number of stage carriage permits in certain towns and cities with a population of not less than five lakhs.", "jurisdiction": "state", "state": "andaman-nicobar", "instrument_type": "legislation", "act_status": "in_force", "in_force": true, "doc_type": "legislation", "provision_type": "general", "section_type": "section", "legal_subject": "['general']", "has_proviso": false, "has_non_obstante": false, "delegation_type": null, "department": "", "regulatory_body": null, "acts_referenced": ["Motor\n\nVehicles Act, 1939"], "defined_terms": [], "amendment_count": 0, "year": 1939.0, "source_url": "https://www.indiacode.nic.in/handle/123456789/19318?view_type=browse", "language_code": "en", "source_publisher": "Legislative Department, Ministry of Law and Justice (India Code)", "mirror_url": "https://oss-data-in.vaquill.ai/legislation/IND_state_19318/act.pdf", "record_id": "0439c4cebd08761330d2", "preprocessing_info": {"source_record_number": 339, "original_text_length": 861, "cleaned_text_length": 861, "transformations